Package: minidlna-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: lvleo21 <33973789+lvleo21@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.6), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.1), pkexec | policykit-1, acl, systemd
Recommends: minidlna
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/lvleo21/minidlna-manager
Description: Desktop app to manage the MiniDLNA service
 GTK4/libadwaita application to manage the MiniDLNA (DLNA/UPnP-AV) server:
 start, stop, restart and enable the service at boot, read its log, edit
 /etc/minidlna.conf through a validated form and inspect connected devices.
 .
 The UI never runs elevated: every privileged operation goes through a
 dedicated helper authorized via Polkit. MiniDLNA itself is only recommended,
 not required -- the app offers to install it on first run if missing.
